  "original_poem": "धर्मक्षेत्रे कुरुक्षेत्रे समवेता युयुत्सवः।\nमामकाः पाण्डवाश्चैव किमकुर्वत सञ्जय॥\n\nन हि प्रपश्यामि ममापनुद्याद्यच्छोकमुच्छोषणमिन्द्रियाणाम्।\nअवाप्य भूमावसपत्नमृद्धं राज्यं सुराणामपि चाधिपत्यम्॥",
  "translated_poem": "In the field of righteousness, in the field of Kurukshetra,\nGathered are those eager for battle, my sons and the sons of Pandu—what did they do, O Sanjaya?\n\nFor I see not that which would remove my sorrow, which dries up my senses.\nEven if I should gain undisputed sovereignty over the earth and mastery over the gods.",
